 {title:'What the town carries forward',prompt:'The council proposes a community maintenance fund before the campaign ends. Look at the services already provided and the cash after debt.',choices:[choice('Back the community fund','Continuing public work needs dedicated funding and responsibility. The service points are a fictional representation.','town-water-maintenance'),choice('Keep the funds','The retained funds support the treasury goal, with no added service award. Compare both goals rather than assuming cash is the only outcome.','town-business-costs')]}
